<title>JAPAN: Sony shares hit fresh high for financial year.</title>
<headline>Sony shares hit fresh high for financial year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Sony Corp surged to a fresh high for the financial year on Wednesday morning, helped by the yen's weaker trend against the dollar, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0031 GMT, the share was up 130 yen at 8,680 yen. Its previous high for the financial year was 8,560 yen.</p>
<p>Volume was 1.57 million shares and the issue was the 12th most heavily traded on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
